---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="py-12 px-4 border-t border-white/5">
  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-8">
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center md:justify-start gap-2 mb-4">
          <img src="/logo-assistech-bot.png" alt="AssisTech BOT Logo" width="160" height="32" class="h-8 object-contain" />
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm max-w-xs">
          Seu assistente técnico inteligente. Compatibilidade, O.S. e gestão direto no seu WhatsApp.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center md:items-end gap-4">
        <div class="flex gap-6 text-ice font-bold text-sm">
          <a href="#como-funciona" class="hover:text-neon transition-colors">Como funciona</a>
          <a href="#precos" class="hover:text-neon transition-colors">Preços</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-neon transition-colors">Dúvidas</a>
        </div>
        <p class="text-muted text-xs">
          © {year} AssisTech BOT. Todos os direitos reservados.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-white/5 text-center">
      <p class="text-[10px] text-muted uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">
        Operado por <span class="text-ice">Logos Company</span> em parceria com <span class="text-ice">Guilherme Tech</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
